# The image only COPYs p1/ p2/ p3/ bonus/ demo_app/ and the Makefile. Without
# this file every build uploaded ~190 MB of local caches (.lint-venv,
# .mypy_cache) and baked host-compiled __pycache__ into the image.
.git
.lint-venv
.mypy_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.ioc.tmp
.chroma_db
presentation
docs
docu
# Test suites and their frozen fixture are for `make test` on the host only.
**/tests
